.TH BAL 1 "2026" "BalOS 1.0" "BalOS Manual"
.SH NAME
bal \- BalOS unified command
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B bal
[\fICOMMAND\fR] [\fIARGS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBbal\fR is the single entry point to every BalOS-specific facility:
power profiles, security posture, network tooling, pentesting workspaces,
and system maintenance.

With no arguments it launches an interactive fzf menu.
.SH COMMANDS
.SS POWER
.TP
.B boost
Gaming performance profile: performance governor, turbo enabled,
PipeWire 256-sample quantum, GameMode, high-perf GPU.
.TP
.B saver
Extreme battery profile: powersave governor, turbo disabled, SMT off,
half cores parked, USB autosuspend, screen dim.
Designed to roughly double battery life vs. a default Arch install.
.TP
.B monitor
Live TUI dashboard with per-core CPU bars, network sparklines, and
hotkey shortcuts (b/s/p/r/q).
.SS SECURITY
.TP
.B shield \fILEVEL\fR
Firewall: \fIoff\fR | \fInormal\fR | \fIarmor\fR (drop inbound, rate-limit
outbound) | \fIfortress\fR (VPN kill-switch, deny everything except wg0).
.TP
.B stealth on|off|test|leaks
Enable Tor + DNSCrypt + randomized MAC on all NICs. \fItest\fR runs
IP/DNS/WebRTC leak checks.
.TP
.B vault \fISUBCMD\fR
GPG-backed password & secrets store.
.TP
.B sandbox \fIAPP\fR
Launch APP in a firejail sandbox with BalOS profiles.
.TP
.B panic \fITIER\fR
Emergency sanitize: \fIsoft\fR (clear history/clipboard), \fIhard\fR (also
kill browsers + randomize MAC + flush caches), \fInuclear\fR (also wipe
encrypted swap, unmount sensitive dirs, lock all sessions).
.TP
.B rescue \fISUBCMD\fR
Anti-forensics: wipe RAM, shred swap, zero free disk space.
.SS NETWORK
.TP
.B vpn up|down|status
WireGuard tunnel control (default interface: wg0).
.TP
.B geo \fISUBCMD\fR
Per-SSID auto-profiles: define trusted networks, untrusted networks fall
back to fortress + stealth automatically.
.SS HACKING
.TP
.B hack \fIMODE\fR
Spawn a tmux workspace pre-configured for: \fIrecon\fR, \fIweb\fR,
\fIwifi\fR, \fIreverse\fR, \fIforensics\fR, \fIcrack\fR, or \fIosint\fR.
.TP
.B recon \fITARGET\fR
Automated multi-stage enumeration (nmap → services → web probes →
exploit suggestions).
.TP
.B pwn \fISUBCMD\fR
Reverse-shell generator (all languages) and integrated listener.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
\fBbal boost\fR
Enter gaming performance mode.
.TP
\fBbal hack wifi wlan0\fR
Launch WiFi audit workspace on wlan0.
.TP
\fBbal shield fortress\fR
VPN kill-switch: nothing leaves the machine outside wg0.
.TP
\fBbal geo auto-on\fR
From now on, BalOS chooses firewall + VPN based on the WiFi SSID.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/skel/.config/balos/config
Per-user preferences (default profile, panic actions, geofence rules).
.TP
.I /etc/balos/
System-wide BalOS configs (firewall presets, geofence DB).
